EFI loader test notes

The full-test.sh script builds standalone loaders, creates FreeBSD boot images,
and generates QEMU test scripts. It requires a suitable build environment,
QEMU/EDK2 firmware, and test trees outside the source directory.
Kboot/Linux-kexec and native U-Boot loader paths have been removed.
Retained EFI testing should cover fresh installs, boot environments, and the
bhyve userboot path separately.
